						<ee:set-payload ><![CDATA[%dw 2.0
output application/java
---
vars.nullRecords map ( nullRecord , indexOfNullRecord ) -> {
	Name: nullRecord.Name,
	Id__c: nullRecord.Id as String,
	Phone_Number__c: nullRecord.phone,
	Address__c: nullRecord.Address,
	Email__c: nullRecord.Email
}]]></ee:set-payload>
